        "original_id": "ae0688f9-e820-5d94-bb4f-af8c1b4dfb9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johan Henrik Deuntzer\n- Organizations: Venstre, Danish Social Liberal Party\n- Places: Denmark\n- Topics: Danish politics, social liberalism\n\nFacts:\n- Johan Henrik Deuntzer was born on 20 May 1845 and died on 16 November 1918.\n- Johan Henrik Deuntzer was a Danish politician.\n- Johan Henrik Deuntzer was a member of the Liberal party Venstre until 1905.\n- In 1905, Johan Henrik Deuntzer joined the Danish Social Liberal Party.\n- The Danish Social Liberal Party is a social-liberal political party in Denmark.\n- The Danish Social Liberal Party is called \"Radikale Venstre\" in Danish, meaning \"Radical Left\" or \"Radical Liberal Party.\"",
